Emergency Elevator Monitoring System - Raspberry Pi 5 Project
Project Overview
A real-time emergency monitoring and response system for multiple elevators across different buildings and floors, running on a Raspberry Pi 5. The system provides visual management of elevator locations, emergency alert handling, and acknowledgment capabilities through an intuitive drag-and-drop interface.
System Purpose
Monitor emergency button activations from networked elevators and provide immediate visual and audible alerts to operators, ensuring rapid response to emergency situations. The system requires explicit operator acknowledgment to dismiss alerts and communicates resolution status back to the elevator nodes.
