Power Supply (27W USB-C PD adapter recommended)
MicroSD Card (32GB minimum, Class 10 or better)

Software Architecture
Operating System

Raspberry Pi OS (64-bit, Desktop version)
Python 3.11+ runtime environment

Technology Stack
Backend:

Python - Core application logic
Flask/FastAPI - Web server and REST API
Socket Programming - UDP/TCP listener for elevator emergency packets
SQLite - Local database for configuration and event logging
Threading/AsyncIO - Concurrent packet monitoring and web server operation

Frontend:

HTML5/CSS3/JavaScript - User interface
React or Vue.js - Interactive component framework
