Network Packet Specification
Emergency Activation Packet (Elevator → RPi5)
json{
  "type": "emergency",
  "elevator_id": "ELEV-B2-F05",
  "building": "Building 2",
  "floor": 5,
  "timestamp": "2025-12-29T14:32:15Z",
  "status": "active",
  "ip_address": "192.168.1.105"
}
Acknowledgment Packet (RPi5 → Elevator)
json{
  "type": "acknowledgment",
  "elevator_id": "ELEV-B2-F05",
  "timestamp": "2025-12-29T14:33:02Z",
  "operator": "Station-1",
  "status": "acknowledged"
}
