Performance Requirements

Packet reception latency: < 100ms from network receipt to alert trigger
UI responsiveness: Dashboard updates within 200ms
Alert activation time: < 500ms from packet receipt to audible alarm
System uptime: 99.9% availability target
Concurrent emergencies: Support minimum 50 simultaneous active alerts

